# RF bring-up recipe that WORKS on m2468 — 2026-11-05
# After the modem is running and SIM is ready, a DMS power cycle re-initialises the RF:
#   qmicli -d qrtr://0 --dms-set-operating-mode=low-power
#   sleep 8
#   qmicli -d qrtr://0 --dms-set-operating-mode=online
